Package: nimbleQuad
Title: Laplace Approximation, Quadrature, and Nested Deterministic Approximation Methods for 'nimble'
Description: Provides deterministic approximation methods for use with the 'nimble' package. These include Laplace approximation and higher-order extension of Laplace approximation using adaptive Gauss-Hermite quadrature (AGHQ), plus nested deterministic approximation methods related to the INLA approach. A full User Manual is available at <https://r-nimble.org>.
